       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Social determinants of health:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " risks (neighborhood and family violence, food security, family substance use, harm from the Internet), strengths and protective factors (emotional security and self-esteem, connectedness with family and peers)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
